&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;破産更生債権及びこれらに準ずる債権額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
